description: Do not add AI co-author attribution to commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No commit / PR co-author attribution

When creating git commits or pull requests:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` trailers of any kind (including Cursor, Cursor Agent, or similar).
- Do **not** add `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, or other AI attribution footers.
- Keep the commit/PR body limited to the human-authored message only.

If a tool or template suggests adding attribution, omit it.
